type: software

title: "Structural Explainability Mapping: Assurance"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-29"

authors:
  - family-names: Case
    given-names: Denise M.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6165-7389"
    affiliation: "Northwest Missouri State University, School of Computer Science and Information Systems, Maryville, MO, USA"

repository-code: "https://github.com/structural-explainability/se-mapping-assurance"
url: "https://github.com/structural-explainability/se-mapping-assurance"

license: MIT

abstract: >
  Assurance-domain mapping record schema and structural validation for
  the Structural Explainability ecosystem. This repository defines and
  validates the record format used to map external assurance and evaluation
  frameworks against Structural Assurability. Validation checks record
  completeness and internal consistency. It does not determine whether
  a framework has a gap, whether a theorem applies to a real system,
  or whether an assurance argument is justified.

